---

---

<section id="about" class="py-32 px-6 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative group max-w-sm w-full">
          <div
            class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ec4899] to-[#8b5cf6] rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition duration-500"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-[#121216] shadow-2xl"
          >
            <img
              src="/hero/ezgif-frame-001.png"
              alt="Matias Diaz"
              class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover object-center filter contrast-105 saturate-105 group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500"
            />
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#07070a] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-80"
            >
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
              <span
                class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#f472b6] uppercase block mb-1"
                >Matias Diaz</span
              >
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300"
                >Front-end Software Engineer</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div
          class="p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#121216]/80 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl"
        >
          <h2
            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2 tracking-tight"
          >
            <span class="lang-en">About me</span>
            <span class="lang-es hidden">Sobre mí</span>
          </h2>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#f472b6] mb-6">
            <span class="lang-en">Who am I?</span>
            <span class="lang-es hidden">¿Quién soy?</span>
          </h3>
          <div
            class="text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4 mb-8 font-light"
          >
            <p class="lang-en">
              I work as a front-end software engineer, I design and build
              powerful interfaces and reusable components using React and
              Next.js. I also use Tailwind for styling and Figma for software
              prototyping. I have fundamental back-end knowledge in C# and
              ASP.NET, as well as practical use of MySQL and MongoDB databases
              for CRUD operations and basic modeling. I work with Git and GitHub
              for collaborative workflows and continuous integration. I focus on
              performance, accessibility, and delivering maintainable solutions.
              I also enjoy solving complex problems and collaborating with
              multidisciplinary teams, participating in code reviews and agile
              methodologies to achieve common goals and continuously improve.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-es hidden">
              Trabajo como ingeniero de software front-end, diseño y construyo
              interfaces potentes y componentes reutilizables utilizando React y
              Next.js. También uso Tailwind para estilos y Figma para el
              prototipado de software. Tengo conocimientos fundamentales de
              back-end en C# y ASP.NET, así como uso práctico de bases de datos
              MySQL y MongoDB para operaciones CRUD y modelado básico. Trabajo
              con Git y GitHub para flujos de trabajo colaborativos e
              integración continua. Me enfoco en el rendimiento, la
              accesibilidad y la entrega de soluciones mantenibles. También me
              gusta resolver problemas complejos y colaborar con equipos
              multidisciplinarios, participando en revisiones de código y
              metodologías ágiles para lograr objetivos comunes y mejorar
              continuamente.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#00d8ff]/10 border border-[#00d8ff]/30 text-[#00d8ff] font-medium text-sm"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 animate-spin-slow"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
            >
              <ellipse
                cx="12"
                cy="12"
                rx="9"
                ry="3.5"
                transform="rotate(30 12 12)"></ellipse>
              <ellipse
                cx="12"
                cy="12"
                rx="9"
                ry="3.5"
                transform="rotate(90 12 12)"></ellipse>
              <ellipse
                cx="12"
                cy="12"
                rx="9"
                ry="3.5"
                transform="rotate(150 12 12)"></ellipse>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle>
            </svg>
            <span class="italic font-semibold">Team React</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .animate-spin-slow {
    animation: spin 12s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin {
    to {
      transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
  }
  .hidden {
    display: none !important;
  }
</style>
